# Richness: the words a brain is taught for finish, one shape each: a stroke character per brush, a fill texture per texture,
# a feathered edge, a gradient, and a painting the renderer makes itself. pnpm check plays it and looks for them on screen.

look paper
scene show figure lines=3 neutral steady
path ink_brush brush=ink stroke=ink thick=3 | M6,14 C11,2 21,20 26,8
path dry_brush brush=dry stroke=ink thick=3 | M30,14 C35,2 45,20 50,8
path plain_brush stroke=ink thick=3 | M54,14 C59,2 69,20 74,8
rect wash_tex 78,4 20x14 fill=accent tex=wash
rect hatch_tex 6,22 20x14 fill=alt tex=hatch
rect dots_tex 30,22 20x14 fill=accent tex=dots
rect grain_tex 54,22 20x14 fill=alt tex=grain
rect weave_tex 78,22 20x14 fill=accent tex=weave
circle soft_edge 16,47 7 fill=accent stroke=none soft=3
rect gradient_fill 30,40 20x14 fill=accent>alt
group land at=0,0
path hill in=land fill=accent stroke=none | M6,88 Q30,58 56,74 T98,70 L98,88 Z
circle sun in=land 84,64 5 fill=alt stroke=none
poly pine in=land 22,80 28,60 34,80 fill=ink stroke=none
paint art 6,58 92x30 over=land as=watercolor | a small landscape in washes
say | Top row: an ink brush, a dry brush, a plain stroke and a wash.
say | Then hatch, dots, grain and weave, a soft edge and a gradient.
say | Below, a painting the renderer makes from three plain shapes.
wait 4
